{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-estimation-testing","title":"成本预估与测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/cost-estimation-testing","wordCount":1113,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本预估与测试\">成本预估与测试</h1><p>基础设施变更的成本影响往往在 <code>terraform apply</code> 之后才显现——月底账单上的意外飙升、被遗忘的测试资源持续计费、或者一次&quot;无害&quot;的实例类型升级导致每月多出数千美元开支。成本预估测试将成本验证从事后审计前移到变更审批阶段，使&quot;这次变更要花多少钱&quot;成为 PR review 中的标准信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>成本预估</strong>：在 <code>terraform apply</code> 之前，基于 plan 输出和云定价 API 计算变更的成本影响</li>\n<li><strong>Infracost</strong>：开源 IaC 成本估算工具，支持 PR 级成本对比和门禁</li>\n<li><strong>成本策略门禁</strong>：超过阈值时要求额外审批或阻断部署</li>\n<li><strong>测试资源成本追踪</strong>：通过 TTL 标签、Spot 实例和预算告警控制测试成本</li>\n<li><strong>成本异常检测</strong>：用统计方法（均值+标准差）识别非正常的开支波动</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"成本预估的工作原理\">成本预估的工作原理</h2><p>成本预估工具分析 <code>terraform plan</code> 的 JSON 输出，将资源变更映射到云平台的定价 API：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[terraform plan] --&gt; B[plan.json]&#10;    B --&gt; C[成本预估引擎]&#10;    C --&gt; D[云定价 API]&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E[成本报告]&#10;    E --&gt; F[PR 评论 / 门禁]\">graph LR\n    A[terraform plan] --&gt; B[plan.json]\n    B --&gt; C[成本预估引擎]\n    C --&gt; D[云定价 API]\n    D --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E[成本报告]\n    E --&gt; F[PR 评论 / 门禁]</pre><p>核心计算模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta Cost_{monthly} = \\sum_{r \\in resources} (Price_{after}(r) - Price_{before}(r)) \\times Usage(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3274em;vertical-align:-1.2774em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ces</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Price_{after}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Price_{before}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是变更前后的资源单价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Usage</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是预估的月度用量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"infracost-iac-成本估算的事实标准\">Infracost：IaC 成本估算的事实标准</h2><p>Infracost 是最广泛使用的开源 IaC 成本估算工具，支持 Terraform/OpenTofu/Terragrunt：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 基于 plan 文件估算成本&#10;tofu plan -out=tfplan&#10;tofu show -json tfplan &gt; plan.json&#10;infracost breakdown --path plan.json&#10;&#10;# 对比两个版本的成本差异&#10;infracost diff --path plan.json --compare-to baseline.json&#10;&#10;# 输出 JSON 供自动化处理&#10;infracost breakdown --path plan.json --format json &gt; cost.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基于 plan 文件估算成本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tofu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -out=tfplan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tofu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tfplan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">infracost</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> breakdown</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对比两个版本的成本差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">infracost</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --compare-to</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> baseline.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出 JSON 供自动化处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">infracost</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> breakdown</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cost.json</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型输出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Project: infrastructure/production&#10;&#10; Name                              Monthly Qty  Unit         Monthly Cost&#10;&#10; aws_instance.app&#10; ├─ Instance usage (m5.xlarge)            730  hours              $140.16&#10; ├─ root_block_device&#10; │  └─ Storage (gp3, 100 GB)             100  GB                   $8.00&#10; └─ ebs_block_device[0]&#10;    └─ Storage (gp3, 500 GB)             500  GB                  $40.00&#10;&#10; aws_rds_instance.primary&#10; ├─ Database instance (db.r5.large)      730  hours              $172.80&#10; └─ Storage (gp2, 200 GB)               200  GB                  $23.00&#10;&#10; OVERALL TOTAL                                               $383.96/mo&#10;&#10;──────────────────────────────────&#10; Monthly cost change: +$188.16&#10; Percent change: +96%\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Project: infrastructure/production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Name                              Monthly Qty  Unit         Monthly Cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> aws_instance.app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ Instance usage (m5.xlarge)            730  hours              $140.16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ root_block_device</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> │  └─ Storage (gp3, 100 GB)             100  GB                   $8.00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ ebs_block_device[0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └─ Storage (gp3, 500 GB)             500  GB                  $40.00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> aws_rds_instance.primary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ Database instance (db.r5.large)      730  hours              $172.80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ Storage (gp2, 200 GB)               200  GB                  $23.00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> OVERALL TOTAL                                               $383.96/mo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>──────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Monthly cost change: +$188.16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Percent change: +96%</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"成本策略门禁\">成本策略门禁</h2><p>将成本预估集成为 CI/CD 门禁，超过阈值时阻断部署：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略类型</th>\n<th>示例规则</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绝对阈值</td>\n<td>月增量 &gt; $500</td>\n<td>需要额外审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>百分比阈值</td>\n<td>变更幅度 &gt; 50%</td>\n<td>需要 FinOps 团队确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源类型限制</td>\n<td>禁止创建 GPU 实例</td>\n<td>阻断 PR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算上限</td>\n<td>月度总预算不超过 $10,000</td>\n<td>阻断超出部分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>使用 Conftest 实现成本策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# policy/cost.rego&#10;package cost&#10;&#10;deny[msg] {&#10;    input.totalMonthlyCost &gt; 500&#10;    msg := sprintf(&#10;        &quot;月度成本增量 $%.2f 超过 $500 阈值，需要 FinOps 审批&quot;,&#10;        [input.totalMonthlyCost]&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;warn[msg] {&#10;    resource := input.projects[_].breakdown.resources[_]&#10;    resource.monthlyCost &gt; 200&#10;    msg := sprintf(&#10;        &quot;资源 %s 月度成本 $%.2f 超过单资源警告阈值&quot;,&#10;        [resource.name, resource.monthlyCost]&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># policy/cost.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deny[msg] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.totalMonthlyCost > 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"月度成本增量 $%.2f 超过 $500 阈值，需要 FinOps 审批\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        [input.totalMonthlyCost]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>warn[msg] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource := input.projects[_].breakdown.resources[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource.monthlyCost > 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"资源 %s 月度成本 $%.2f 超过单资源警告阈值\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        [resource.name, resource.monthlyCost]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"pr-中的成本可视化\">PR 中的成本可视化</h2><p>在 Pull Request 中自动添加成本对比评论，使审查者在合并前了解成本影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 集成&#10;- name: Post Cost Comment&#10;  run: |&#10;    infracost comment github \\&#10;      --path /tmp/infracost.json \\&#10;      --repo ${{ github.repository }} \\&#10;      --pull-request ${{ github.event.pull_request.number }} \\&#10;      --github-token ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }} \\&#10;      --behavior update\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 集成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Post Cost Comment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    infracost comment github \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --path /tmp/infracost.json \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --repo ${{ github.repository }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --pull-request ${{ github.event.pull_request.number }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --github-token ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --behavior update</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PR 评论中的成本摘要格式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>之前</th>\n<th>之后</th>\n<th>差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>networking</td>\n<td>$45/mo</td>\n<td>$45/mo</td>\n<td>+$0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>compute</td>\n<td>$280/mo</td>\n<td>$468/mo</td>\n<td><strong>+$188</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>database</td>\n<td>$172/mo</td>\n<td>$172/mo</td>\n<td>+$0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>总计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>$497/mo</strong></td>\n<td><strong>$685/mo</strong></td>\n<td><strong>+$188 (+38%)</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"测试资源的成本追踪\">测试资源的成本追踪</h2><p>测试环境本身的资源成本需要独立追踪和控制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cost_{testing} = \\sum_{tests} N_{resources}(t) \\times Price(t) \\times Duration(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ces</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最佳实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>强制 TTL 标签</strong>：所有测试资源必须带 <code>TTL</code> 标签，定时清扫超期资源</li>\n<li><strong>Spot/Preemptible 实例</strong>：测试用计算资源使用竞价实例</li>\n<li><strong>最小规格原则</strong>：测试不需要生产级性能，使用最小实例类型</li>\n<li><strong>成本分配标签</strong>：<code>cost-center: testing</code>、<code>team: platform</code></li>\n<li><strong>日/周预算告警</strong>：测试账户设置日预算上限（如 $100/天）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"成本异常检测\">成本异常检测</h2><p>超越阈值告警，使用统计方法检测异常：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Anomaly = Cost_{actual} &gt; \\mu_{30d} + 2\\sigma_{30d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当实际成本超过过去 30 天均值加两倍标准差时，视为异常。这比固定阈值更灵活——能自动适应业务增长带来的自然成本上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"finops-与基础设施测试的交叉\">FinOps 与基础设施测试的交叉</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>FinOps 实践</th>\n<th>测试中的应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标签策略</td>\n<td>测试资源 100% 打标签以便成本归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算告警</td>\n<td>测试账户设独立预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用量优化</td>\n<td>非工作时间自动销毁测试环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预留实例</td>\n<td>长期运行的测试基础设施用 RI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限最小化</td>\n<td>测试 IAM 角色只允许创建特定资源类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[变更提交] --&gt; B[成本预估]&#10;    B --&gt; C{成本是否合理?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[正常流程]&#10;    C --&gt;|超阈值| E[FinOps 审批]&#10;    E --&gt;|批准| D&#10;    E --&gt;|拒绝| F[优化资源配置]&#10;    F --&gt; A&#10;    D --&gt; G[部署]&#10;    G --&gt; H[成本监控]&#10;    H --&gt;|异常| I[告警 + 调查]\">graph TD\n    A[变更提交] --&gt; B[成本预估]\n    B --&gt; C{成本是否合理?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[正常流程]\n    C --&gt;|超阈值| E[FinOps 审批]\n    E --&gt;|批准| D\n    E --&gt;|拒绝| F[优化资源配置]\n    F --&gt; A\n    D --&gt; G[部署]\n    G --&gt; H[成本监控]\n    H --&gt;|异常| I[告警 + 调查]</pre><p>成本预估不只是节省金钱的工具——它是基础设施变更<em>可预测性</em>的保障。当团队能在 PR 阶段就看到成本影响时，&quot;意外账单&quot;就从事故降级为已知风险。</p>\n<p>关于测试环境成本隔离的详细策略，参见 <a href=\"../foundations/testing-environments-strategies\">测试环境与策略</a>。关于漂移检测中发现的成本偏差如何处理，参见 <a href=\"drift-detection-reconciliation\">漂移检测与修复</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>成本预估测试将&quot;这次变更要花多少钱&quot;从事后审计前移到 PR 审查阶段。Infracost 基于 plan JSON 和云定价 API 提供精确的月度成本变化预估，配合 Conftest 策略规则实现成本门禁自动化。测试环境本身的成本通过 TTL 标签、Spot 实例、最小规格和预算告警来系统控制。成本预估的最终价值不只是节省金钱——它是基础设施变更可预测性的保障。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成本预估与测试","id":"成本预估与测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本预估的工作原理","id":"成本预估的工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"Infracost：IaC 成本估算的事实标准","id":"infracost-iac-成本估算的事实标准"},{"level":2,"text":"成本策略门禁","id":"成本策略门禁"},{"level":2,"text":"PR 中的成本可视化","id":"pr-中的成本可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"测试资源的成本追踪","id":"测试资源的成本追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"成本异常检测","id":"成本异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"FinOps 与基础设施测试的交叉","id":"finops-与基础设施测试的交叉"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"漂移检测与修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/drift-detection-reconciliation"},"next":null}